3
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">I don't have to hide anything now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,320
<font color="#ffffff">You've been lying the whole time?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">All this time,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,560
<font color="#ffffff">what part was real?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:55,080
<font color="#ffffff">Let's just say</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not going to tell my boss</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that I saw you here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

9
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:02,960
