<font color="#ffffff">are that intimate?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

10
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">I think it's highly likely</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that this was a staged heist.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

11
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">He has amnesia.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Does he really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,600
<font color="#ffffff">I think he really does.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,720
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'll help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you better than me? You liar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">Are you that upset with me?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Just let it out.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

18
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">I just want to let you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">that I never pretended</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">when I was with you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

20
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:30,320
<font color="#ffffff">This woman just feels bad</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because she got caught.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

21
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">She doesn't regret it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">Are you here to see my junior disciple?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">If you know you're wrong,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,520
<font color="#ffffff">there's no shame</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">in being the first to apologize.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">Those who can admit they're wrong</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">are the strongest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">Will he think I'm bothering him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,320
<font color="#ffffff">I should go back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,040
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:54,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, couples should always</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">talk things out after a fight.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

33
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's no good staying mad</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">at each other for too long.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

34
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">Adults really do like</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to complicate things.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

35
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,680
<font color="#ffffff">When I grow up,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">I don't think I want a girlfriend.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'll just stay with Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">Who was that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, please run!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Follow her!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,200
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let's take care of her somewhere else</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">before anyone sees.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

44
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,880
<font color="#ffffff">Get her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,240
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">You want me to watch Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">I want you to secretly keep an eye on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't let anyone notice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Especially Lieutenant Ae.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">What do you suspect the Deputy of?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">I suspect he's involved</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with Ms. Yok's diamond,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

55
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,520
<font color="#ffffff">one way or another.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,640
<font color="#ffffff">You're not making any sense.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">Of course, he's involved with this case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:10,200
<font color="#ffffff">He's the one leading the investigation.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not talking about his role as a cop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm saying he might be a suspect.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's a serious matter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's why I want you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to investigate him quietly.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

63
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:37,919
<font color="#ffffff">But it's fine if you'd rather not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, it's nothing like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">I just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just thinking about</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">what I need to do to find out more.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad I made the right call</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,960
<font color="#ffffff">asking for your help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">He calls himself my senior disciple,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:15,520
<font color="#ffffff">but he won't even help me with this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Must be nice to be a spirit, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Junior.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

74
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,320
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Tofu.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">I told you, stop showing up like this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:32,520
<font color="#ffffff">Save your complaints. Noona is in danger.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:35,320
<font color="#ffffff">What? What happened to Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,320
<font color="#ffffff">So? Where is she?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">She was right there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,120
<font color="#ffffff">I can't see her anywhere. Where's Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">Blood?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">This is bad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,560
<font color="#ffffff">Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,280
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">Noona?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">Wake up, Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">Is Noona already dead?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">If she becomes a ghost,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">she'll be terrifying.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

92
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm scared of that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">She's not dead, Tofu.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">She's like a sleeping princess.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:07,000
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe you need to kiss her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,840
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, how can you joke around</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">at a time like this, Tofu?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

98
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">If you're not going to help, be quiet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, you need to wake up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,760
<font color="#ffffff">You're investigating me, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,600
<font color="#ffffff">There's still a lot you don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, wake up. Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,520
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, you have to be okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">What do we do, Junior?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go to a hospital.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't you scared of getting caught?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,920
<font color="#ffffff">Noona's awake!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">Noona,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">you're okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">I was so worried about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">I thought I'd never see you again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,640
<font color="#ffffff">You're safe now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">You shouldn't have come</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to see me, Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

115
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">It's fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:22,360
<font color="#ffffff">You have only one child.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:27,040
<font color="#ffffff">I came to see you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so he could get some rest.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

118
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Wayu, you're here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,240
<font color="#ffffff">I am, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">Greetings, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">Blessings to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,000
<font color="#ffffff">Look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea bought us a lot of food.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">Since I'm here,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'd also like to give you a Dhamma book.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">If you get bored, you can read it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:38,400
<font color="#ffffff">Here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, this is wonderful, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:15:42,560 --> 00:15:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">I was going to ask Wayu</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to bring me some books from home.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

133
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">This one is interesting.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:51,560
<font color="#ffffff">This book…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:55,200
<font color="#ffffff">is mainly about doing good deeds</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:15:55,280 --> 00:15:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">without expecting anything in return.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">A good deed is only truly good</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">if you expect nothing in return.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:15,520
<font color="#ffffff">It's like clear water, free of impurities.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">Reading this will help you feel calm</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:22,400
<font color="#ffffff">and soothe your heart.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:30,160
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Sadhu.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for visiting my dad, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:17:08,359 --> 00:17:13,440
<font color="#ffffff">He seems much more at ease</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">after talking to you about Dhamma.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

145
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:17,240
<font color="#ffffff">It's nothing much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">Sometimes, learning</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just a little Dhamma is enough<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

147
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">to make someone smile through their pain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,440
<font color="#ffffff">I understand, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">you should come here anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's been really awkward for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:48,240
<font color="#ffffff">This is the last time</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:50,680
<font color="#ffffff">I can let you go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">The next time we meet,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:17:57,440 --> 00:18:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">I might have to take you in as ordered.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">I understand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">In this world,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:16,760
<font color="#ffffff">everyone has a duty,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">even if it does not feel right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,640
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for understanding.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:34,480
<font color="#ffffff">But can I ask you one thing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">Of course.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:47,080
<font color="#ffffff">Have you ever closed your eyes</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">and asked yourself</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">if the path you're walking now</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">is truly the life you've always wanted?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:09,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not judging</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">whether you're good or evil.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:16,400
<font color="#ffffff">I believe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">who a person really is</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">depends on what they choose to do</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">while they can still change their path.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

172
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,560
<font color="#ffffff">I believe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">you can still change.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get going now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:57,440
